## Technical Documentation

### NYX Technical Development Report

[`NYX Technical Development Report`](documentation/NYX_Technical_Development_Report.pdf)

The report documents the wider development of the NYX UAV, including aircraft design, electronics, control systems and propulsion-system activities.

It is included here to provide **aircraft-level context for the propulsion work** and to show how the electric propulsion system interacted with the wider UAV architecture.

> **Note:** The report represents multidisciplinary team work. My primary responsibility within the programme was the design, testing and integration of the electric propulsion system as Head of the Electric Propulsion Department.

